# API Documentation

This document will contain the comprehensive API documentation for the authentication and authorization system. It will detail all endpoints, request/response formats, authentication requirements, and error codes.

## Authentication Endpoints

*   `POST /api/auth/register`: User registration
*   `POST /api/auth/login`: User login
*   `GET /api/auth/refresh`: Refresh access token
*   `POST /api/auth/logout`: User logout

## User Management Endpoints (Admin Only)

*   `GET /api/users`: Get all users
*   `PUT /api/users/:id/role`: Update user role

